  "referenceNumber": "RUS1660",
  "remarks": "\nColonel Maxim Alexandrovich LOKTEV currently holds the position of Military Commissar of Moscow. LOKTEV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because he is or has engaged in policies or actions which destabilise Ukraine and undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
